      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Previously in Build `1948`, Quick Menu was in sync with Social tab but out of sync with Main Menu.\n\nNow in Build `1951` Quick Menu and Main Menu are *sometimes* in sync (but in this case out of sync within minutes), and both are always out of sync with the Social tab.",
